@quotation
@strong{In this language: the metacircular evaluator.}

The evaluator reads checked TypeScript source through the shared reader,
classifies nodes through syntax procedures, and evaluates them in environments
that hold shared cells.  The later analysis pass turns each expression into an
execution procedure, while the typed @code{Outcome} carries evaluation errors
back to the driver.
@end quotation
